jin044-lu-rendered/identity-readings.json#manfen","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p007","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021:m0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"滿奮","kind":"person","person_id":"m2r_kh3_98l","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021:m0090","start":90,"end":91,"surface":"奮","kind":"person","person_id":"m2r_kh3_98l","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p007","text":"及乂死，穎表志為中書監，留鄴，參署相府事。乘與敗于蕩陰，穎遣志督兵迎帝。及王浚攻鄴，志勸穎奉天子還洛陽。時甲士尚萬五千人，志夜部分，至曉，眾皆成列，而程太妃戀鄴不欲去，穎未能決。俄而眾潰，唯志與子謐、兄子綝、殿中武賁千人而已，志復勸穎早發。時有道士姓黃，號曰聖人，太妃信之。及使呼人，道士求兩杯酒，飲訖，拋杯而去，於是志計始決。而人馬復散，志于營陣間尋索，得數乘鹿車，司馬督韓玄收集黃門，得百餘人。志入，帝問志曰：「何故散敗至此？」志曰：「賊去鄴尚八十里，而人士一朝駭散，太弟今欲奉陛下還洛陽。」帝曰：「甚佳。」於是禦犢車便發。屯騎校尉郝昌先領兵八千守洛陽，帝召之，至汲郡而昌至，兵仗甚盛。志喜於復振，啟天子宜下赦書，與百姓同其休慶。既達洛陽，志啟以滿奮為司隸校尉。奔散者多還，百官粗備，帝悅，賜志絹二百匹、綿百斤、衣一襲、鶴綾袍一領。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"rendered_tool_line":199,"capture_ref":"source-evidence/jin044-lu-rendered/received-rendered-capture.json","capture_kind":"existing_rendered_text_not_raw","projection":"remove leading ideographic spaces and tool-link wrappers only"},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luqin-family-rendered:p007:m0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"乂","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAR","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"依本篇角色及已列原段，首選沿用現役身份；限制另列。身份審讀：yi。","source_identity_role":"yi","identity_readin